[BILL Spend & Expense + HRIS (Employee Onboarding)](https://www.bill.com/integrations/spend-expense-onboarding): Auto-import and sync employees from systems like BambooHR, Rippling, Workday, UKG, and ADP—making onboarding fast and secure.

